+</head>
+<body>
+  <header class="topbar">
+    <a class="brand" href="./" aria-label="Typeform home"><span class="brand-icon">tf</span>typeform<small>LAB</small></a>
+    <nav class="toplinks" aria-label="Resources"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/font-size-adjust" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Documentation ↗</a><span class="version"><i class="dot"></i> v.01</span></nav>
+  </header>
+  <div class="layout">
+    <aside>
+      <p class="nav-label">The playground</p>
+      <a class="nav-item active" href="#playground" aria-current="page"><span class="symbol">Aa</span> Font proportions</a>
+      <a class="nav-item" href="#theme"><span class="symbol">◧</span> Independent theme</a>
+      <a class="nav-item" href="#how-it-works"><span class="symbol">⌘</span> How it works <span style="margin-left:auto">↗</span></a>
+      <div class="side-note"><div class="little-mark">✳</div>Small details.<br>Better typography.<br><span style="display:block;margin-top:16px;font:9px 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace">MADE FOR THE MODERN WEB</span></div>
+    </aside>
+    <main>
+      <section class="intro"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span style="color:#89956e">✳</span> A typography experiment</div><h1>A little more in proportion.</h1><p>Different fonts. The same visual rhythm.<br>Explore a more harmonious way to mix type on the web.</p></div><span class="lab-badge">CSS, doing the heavy lifting.</span></section>
