+            <div id="mixed-fonts-container"><p>The best ideas start with a little <code>curiosity</code>.<br>Mix in some <code>code</code>, keep your type in balance,<br>and let the details make the difference.</p></div>
+            <div class="sample-footer"><span class="legend" id="regular-legend">DM Sans · Regular</span><span class="legend code" id="code-legend">IBM Plex Mono · Regular</span><span class="edit-hint">One size. A shared x-height.</span></div>
